<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-QBE 1995/96 net profit A$147.3 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-QBE 1995/96 net profit A$147.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    136.8 vs 115.9</p>
<p>    Net				     147.3 vs  82.5</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     17.0 vs 15.2</p>
<p>NOTE: QBE Insurance Ltd is an insurance group. Pre-tax operating profit is before movement in unrealised gains on investments, but net profit is after the movement in unrealised gains.  </p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	     24.2 vs 21.6</p>
<p>    Sales (billion)			1.50 vs 1.36</p>
<p>    Other income			  466.4 vs 403.2</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    52.8 vs 30.7</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			  nil vs nil</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date October 30</p>
<p>Reg date October  2</p>
<p>    Tax (on operations)		  26.4 vs 12.1</p>
<p>    Interest				  8.4 vs  9.0</p>
<p>    Depreciation			    8.5 vs  8.7</p>
<p>    Minorities				3.3 vs  2.1</p>
<p>NOTE: Movement in unrealised gains on investments after tax A$40.2 million in 1995/96, compared with a loss of A$19.6 million a year earlier.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
